<title>AUSTRIA: Creditanstalt confirms Erste leaves bidders - agency.</title>
<headline>Creditanstalt confirms Erste leaves bidders - agency.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creditanstalt chief executive Guido Schmidt-Chiari on Friday confirmed Die Erste had left an Austro-Italian-German consortium of bidders for the government's stake in the bank, Austrian news agency APA said.</p>
<p>He then asked the Vienna bourse to suspend Creditanstalt's ordinary and preference shares, APA said. &quot;We were of the opinion that this was price sensitive,&quot; he said. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
